="0:36.014">lumea</span> <span begin="0:36.014" end="0:38.549">de-ntuneric</span></p><p begin="0:38.549" end="0:43.618" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:38.549" end="0:39.816">Cerul</span> <span begin="0:39.816" end="0:41.083">este</span> <span begin="0:41.083" end="0:41.717">mai</span> <span begin="0:41.717" end="0:43.618">presus!</span></p><p begin="0:43.618" end="0:48.686" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.618" end="0:44.251">Cu</span> <span begin="0:44.251" end="0:46.152">lumină</span> <span begin="0:46.152" end="0:46.786">și</span> <span begin="0:46.786" end="0:48.686">speranță</span></p><p begin="0:48.686" end="0:53.755" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.686" end="0:50.094">Vine,</span> <span begin="0:50.094" end="0:51.221">vine</span> <span begin="0:51.221" end="0:51.784">iar</span> <span begin="0:51.784" end="0:53.755">Isus!</span></p><p begin="0:53.755" end="0:58.824" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.755" end="0:56.290">Aleluia,</span> <span begin="0:56.290" end="0:57.557">vine</span> <span begin="0:57.557" end="0:58.824">ziua!</span></p><p begin="0:58.824" end="1:06.753" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.824" end="1:00.232">Noapte</span> <span begin="1:00.232" end="1:00.795">grea</span> <span begin="1:00.795" end="1:01.358">a</span> <span begin="1:01.358" end="1:01.992">fost</span> <span begin="1:01.992" end="1:06.753">de-ajuns!</span></p><p begin="1:06.753" end="1:11.822" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.753" end="1:08.020">Ziua</span> <span begin="1:08.020" end="1:10.554">mântuirii</span> <span begin="1:10.554" end="1:11.822">Sale</span></p><p begin="1:11.822" end="1:16.890" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.822" end="1:12.455">Se</span> <span begin="1:12.455" end="1:14.356">arată</span> <span begin="1:14.356" end="1:14.990">în</span> <span begin="1:14.990" end="1:16.890">curând!</span></p><p begin="1:16.890" end="1:21.959" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.890" end="1:17.524">Vor</span> <span begin="1:17.524" end="1:18.791">vedea</span> <span begin="1:18.791" end="1:19.425">cu</span> <span begin="1:19.425" end="1:20.692">toții</span> <span begin="1:20.692" end="1:21.959">slava</span></p><p begin="1:21.959" end="1:27.028" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.959" end="1:22.522">Și</span> <span begin="1:22.522" end="1:24.494">mărirea</span> <span begin="1:24.494" end="1:25.902">Celui</span> <span begin="1:25.902" end="1:27.028">sfânt!</span></p><p begin="1:27.028" end="1:32.097" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.028" end="1:28.929">Așteptați,</span> <span begin="1:28.929" end="1:29.562">în</span> <span begin="1:29.562" end="1:32.097">consacrare,</span></p><p begin="1:32.097" end="1:40.646" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.097" end="1:33.505">Zorii</span> <span begin="1:33.505" end="1:34.631">unui</span> <span begin="1:34.631" end="1:35.265">nou</span> <span begin="1:35.265" end="1:40.646">pământ!</span></p><p begin="1:40.646" end="1:45.740" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.646" end="1:41.282">Vă</span> <span begin="1:41.282" end="1:42.556">treziți,</span> <span begin="1:42.556" end="1:43.829">străjeri</span> <span begin="1:43.829" end="1:44.466">ai</span> <span begin="1:44.466" end="1:45.740">lumii,</span></p><p begin="1:45.740" end="1:50.834" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.740" end="1:48.287">Profeția</span> <span begin="1:48.287" end="1:50.834">s-a-mplinit!</span></p><p begin="1:50.834" end="1:55.928" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.834" end="1:51.471">Nu</span> <span begin="1:51.471" end="1:52.107">mai</span> <span begin="1:52.107" end="1:53.381">este</span> <span begin="1:53.381" end="1:54.018">timp</span> <span begin="1:54.018" end="1:55.928">de-acuma!</span></p><p begin="1:55.928" end="2:01.022" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.928" end="1:57.343">Cine</span> <span begin="1:57.343" end="1:58.475">este</span> <span begin="1:58.475" end="2:01.022">pregătit?</span></p><p begin="2:01.022" end="2:06.116" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.022" end="2:03.569">Aleluia!</span> <span begin="2:03.569" end="2:06.116">Aleluia!</span>